meta {
  name: Get Provider
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/public/providers/{{bookingSlug}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Answers for any provider patients can reach (portal on, active, has a slug). `bookingOpen` is false
  while booking is paused or not ready: `types` and `locations` are then empty and `/slots` answers 404,
  but login and "Mis citas" keep working. `approvalRequired` is true when the provider reviews each
  booking (`REQUIRE_APPROVAL`): the form then sends a request instead of reserving. Unknown, deleted or inactive providers get the same 404.
  `specialty`, `professionalLicense`, `bio`, `phone` and `whatsapp` are optional, also shown while paused.
  `reschedulePolicy` is `{ maxReschedules, minNoticeHours }` only while patients can reschedule (booking open,
  auto-confirm); otherwise null. `loginChannels` is what the login offers: `EMAIL`, `WHATSAPP`
  and `SMS`.
}
